WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.220
Speech is now in beta on Suno, and this is a pretty different kind of feature for us.

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:08.720
Until now, almost everything you made in Suno started with music.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:15.240
With speech, you can create spoken audio with a voice performing your words with tone, pacing, and emotion,

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.220
while Suno creates the background music along with it.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:22.440
And if you want clean speech without the music, you can turn the background music off too.

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:29.940
Now you can do things like narration, spoken word, stories, voiceovers, character pieces, announcements,

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.880
and a bunch of things we probably haven't even thought of yet.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.340
Let me show you how this works.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:36.840
You'll find speech right here inside Create.

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:38.940
Speech is available on mobile too.

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:42.900
I'm going to be doing most of this demo on web, but I'm going to switch over to my phone.
